---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../config/site';
---
<BaseLayout title="Closed Beta" description="Learn about planned closed beta access for the DepthLume Windows desktop market intelligence platform." path="/closed-beta/">
  <article class="container prose-page beta-page">
    <header><span class="eyebrow">Closed Beta</span><h1>DepthLume is preparing for focused evaluation.</h1><p class="lede">The first beta will prioritize product reliability, explainability and careful feedback over broad access.</p></header>
    <div class="beta-status"><span class="status-dot"></span><span class="mono">ACCESS NOT YET OPEN</span></div>
    <section><h2>What beta participants will evaluate</h2><ul><li>Clarity and usefulness of market context.</li><li>Presentation of evidence, conflicts, risks and invalidation.</li><li>Order-flow and public market-data workflow.</li><li>Scenario lifecycle review and false-positive analysis.</li><li>Windows application stability and diagnostics.</li></ul></section>
    <section><h2>What is still being confirmed</h2><p>Access timing, participant capacity, supported markets, data coverage, system requirements and update delivery are not final. This page does not promise admission or a release date.</p></section>
    <section id="contact"><h2>Interest and contact</h2><p>A beta-interest form and contact channel will be added after the official address and data-handling process are approved.</p><div class="contact-placeholder"><span>Contact</span><code>{site.contactPlaceholder}</code></div></section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .beta-page { max-width: 58rem; }
  .beta-status { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; padding: .7rem .9rem; border: 1px solid var(--color-line); border-radius: var(--radius-sm); background: var(--color-panel); color: var(--color-text-muted); font-size: .62rem; }
  .contact-placeholder { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .7rem; margin-top: 1rem; padding: 1rem; border: 1px dashed var(--color-line-strong); border-radius: var(--radius-sm); color: var(--color-text-muted); font-size: .78rem; }
  .contact-placeholder code { color: var(--color-cyan); }
</style>
